<view class="demo">
 <view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">XINGYU · OFFLINE DEMO</text><text class="title">所有页面，有数据可体验</text><text class="copy">复用 v1.0.2.0 原生小程序页面。模拟支付、签约、开柜与认证均只发生在本机。</text><button class="primary" bindtap="home">进入小程序首页</button></view>
 <view class="counts"><view wx:for="{{counts}}" wx:key="label"><text class="value">{{item.value}}</text><text>{{item.label}}</text></view></view>
 <view class="panel"><text class="heading">数据场景</text><view class="chips"><button data-value="normal" bindtap="scenarioChange" class="{{scenario==='normal'?'active':''}}">正常数据</button><button data-value="empty" bindtap="scenarioChange" class="{{scenario==='empty'?'active':''}}">空列表</button><button data-value="error" bindtap="scenarioChange" class="{{scenario==='error'?'active':''}}">读取失败</button><button data-value="loading" bindtap="scenarioChange" class="{{scenario==='loading'?'active':''}}">慢加载</button></view><button class="reset" bindtap="review">模拟发布 / 归还审核通过</button><button class="reset" bindtap="reset">恢复初始演示数据</button></view>
 <view class="panel"><text class="heading">业务规则与模拟事件</text><text class="copy">演示日期：{{demoDate}}。示例订单用于浏览；新建订单会占用设备和优惠券。支付/退款渠道结果须回订单查单；审批和交付在此明确模拟。</text><button class="reset" bindtap="nextDay">推进演示日期一天（体验连续签到）</button><view wx:for="{{events}}" wx:key="id" class="entry"><view><text>{{item.title}}</text><button class="reset" data-order="{{item.orderId}}" data-action="{{item.action}}" bindtap="event">{{item.label}}</button></view></view></view>
 <view class="panel"><text class="heading">页面与体验入口</text><text class="copy">详情入口已带入有效对象。订单各状态均有独立样本。标为“演示补充”的页面，正式源码暂未接入相应操作。</text><view wx:for="{{entries}}" wx:key="key" class="entry" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="open"><view><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="note">{{item.note}}</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view></view>
 <view class="panel"><text class="heading">最近的本地请求</text><text wx:for="{{logs}}" wx:key="index" class="log">{{item.method}} {{item.path}} · {{item.status}}</text></view>
</view>
